37633>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Integer hoInvokingView Integer hoInvokingObject
37636>>>        WebSet pbRender of oNewButton to True
37637>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to True
37638>>>
37638>>>        Case Begin
37638>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
37640>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down
37640>>>                Case Break
37641>>>
37641>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
37644>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent lookup from a Zoom
37644>>>                Case Break
